          "id": "fig-00020",
          "class": "unnumbered scaled-down",
          "caption": null,
          "media": {
            "alt": {
              "segmentId": "m00248:alt:fig-00020-alt",
              "text": "The reaction of an acid anhydride with two equivalents of ammonia gives an amide and an ammonium carboxylate salt."
